    "body": "Codex (m3) read this issue for work and did not claim it. The issue depends on #1864, and #1864 is open with no claim and no pull request.\n\nEvidence on upstream/main `4d4a81fcf`:\n\n- `crates/app/src/sketch_model.rs` `generation_problem` refuses each operation on a DXF profile: \"a toolpath from the chains of a DXF profile is not generated yet\".\n- `FeatureSel` (`crates/app/src/operation/types/sel.rs`) has no sketch chain pick and no `SketchLayer` pick.\n- `collect_job` (`crates/app/src/operation/job.rs`) returns that refusal before it builds a job. No sketch source gets to `Slot` or `TrochoidalSlot`.\n\nThe work of this issue needs the sketch selection, the sketch job and the sketch verify of #1864. A fix here would write those parts a second time and would conflict with #1864.\n\nRecommendation: work #1864 first. The maintainer can set `blocked` on this issue until #1864 merges. No label was changed and no branch was made.\n",
