    "body": "fix on issue/1868-slot-dxf-sketches · PR #2920 · pinned by a_slot_outline_seeds_the_slot_and_cuts_it_to_size, a_trochoidal_slot_reads_the_same_outline, an_open_straight_chain_is_the_centerline_at_the_typed_width, picks_that_are_no_slot_are_refused_by_name (app, `slot_dxf_sketch`), a_centerline_room_holds_its_two_ends_and_refuses_other_ends, a_bent_short_or_doubled_centerline_is_refused_by_name (motion) · merges at the next cut\n\nThe PR is stacked on #2716. Merge #2716 first.\n\nThe PR does the \"Done means\" of this issue: a line-arc slot outline and a straight centerline, named refusals, and no change to the two-point files. It does not do a bent or arc centerline, a closed chain as a centerline, or more than one chain in one operation. These are refused by name. Issue #2912 holds that work.\n",
